# React UI Rules

## Translations

Use `useLanguage()` → `t.*`. No hardcoded Hebrew/English in JSX.

## data-testid (required for new UI)

Interactive or assertable elements need kebab-case test IDs:

```tsx
<Button data-testid="case-upload-btn">...</Button>
<section data-testid="analysis-results">...</section>
```

## Styling

Use CSS variables from `globals.css`: `--brand`, `--surface`, `--heading`, `--muted`.
Reuse `components/ui/` (Button, Card, Badge). Match header/analyzer card patterns.

## Client components

Add `"use client"` only when using hooks, events, or browser APIs.
